# Serene Scene Web

Marketing site (www.serenescene.app) and practice dashboard (app.serenescene.app — coming soon).

## Stack
- Next.js 15 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind v4
- Deployed on Vercel
- Auth via API at api.serenescene.app

## Brand
- Colors: Navy #1B3A5B, Sky #5BC0DE, Pink #E85A9B, Yellow #F4D35E, BG #F8FAFB
- Friendly, calm, professional. NOT clinical.
- Copy voice: warm, plainspoken. No medical claims. "Comfort" and "calm" only.

## Compliance hard rules
- Never use words: "pain", "anxiety treatment", "therapeutic", "medical device", "clinical"
- OK: "comfort", "calm", "distraction", "experience", "relaxation"
- This is a wellness product. No FDA claims.

## Coding rules
- Server components by default. "use client" only when needed.
- No external UI libraries (no shadcn, no MUI). Hand-rolled Tailwind.
- Images: next/image with explicit width/height.